SUMMARY:Revisit: How to Build AI Workflows with Claude Code
DESCRIPTION:A non-engineer can build working tools for discovery work with 
 a coding agent by describing the workflow step by step. The skill is decom
 posing the task\, not writing the code.\n\nWhy it resonated: I want to bui
 ld small tools for my own work instead of specifying them and handing them
  off. This is a concrete example of how.\n\nhttps://www.producttalk.org/ho
 w-to-build-ai-workflows-with-claude-code/
URL:https://www.producttalk.org/how-to-build-ai-workflows-with-claude-code/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
