UID:73a263e0c89bc05a@resonance-log
DTSTAMP:20260905T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Revisit: A Practical Guide to AI Evals
DESCRIPTION:Judge an LLM feature's quality with a written eval set and a me
 asured pass rate\, not by feel\, and iterate the prompt against that bench
 mark.\n\nWhy it resonated: I am learning how to tell whether an LLM featur
 e is actually any good. This is the most concrete method I have found.\n\n
 https://www.producttalk.org/ai-evals/
URL:https://www.producttalk.org/ai-evals/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
