SUMMARY:Revisit: The Non-Technical PM's Guide to Building with Cursor
DESCRIPTION:A non-technical PM can reach a working prototype in Cursor by t
 reating the editor as a conversation and shipping in small steps. The barr
 ier is starting\, not ability.\n\nWhy it resonated: Lowers the cost of pro
 totyping an idea myself\, which is the first move I want to default to on 
 anything new.\n\nhttps://www.lennysnewsletter.com/p/the-non-technical-pms-
 guide-to-building-with-cursor
